msgstr "By step"

msgid "Pas de collage. Le jugement final ne s’exécute pas : il confronte le texte aux deux images, et il n’y en a qu’une."
msgstr "No collage. The final judgement does not run: it checks the text against both images, and there is only one."

msgid "Photographies des recettes"
msgstr "Recipe photographs"

msgid "Plafond par recette"
msgstr "Ceiling per recipe"

